@segment  relax-10
@title    Ten-Point Relaxation
@levels   F10
@from     F1
@verbosity 1
@duration ~2m

say Now we move to the Focus 10 state. Mind awake. Body asleep.
pause 4
level F10
say I will count from one to ten. Nothing to do but hear the numbers.
pause 4
say One.
pause 7
say Two.
pause 7
say Three.
pause 7
say Four.
pause 7
say Five.
pause 7
say Six.
pause 7
say Seven.
pause 7
say Eight.
pause 7
say Nine.
pause 7
say Ten.
pause 8
say Ten. Ten. Ten.
pause 6
say Mind awake. Body asleep.
pause 10
